    <statement><p>Your wardrobe consists of 2 shirts, 4 pairs of pants, and 18 bow ties. How many different outfits can you make?</p>
<p>You can make <fillin characters="5" name="AnSwEr0001"/> outfits.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2\cdot 4\cdot 18</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>There are <m>2 \cdot 4 \cdot 18 = {144}</m> outfits. Use the multiplicative principle.</p>
</solution>
